ust have at least of 112 bits of security. [ Learn more ](https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/update/versions/gitlab_17_changes.html#1770) . \\n\\nAcknowledge \\n\\n<::before>\\n\\nTo help improve GitLab, we would like to periodically [ collect usage information ](/help/administration/settings/usage_statistics.md) . This can be changed at any time in [ your settings ](/admin/application_settings/metrics_and_profiling#js-usage-settings) . \\n\\n[ Send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=1&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=1) [ Don't send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=0&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=0)\\n\\n  1. <::after> [ Admin area  ](/admin)\\n  2. [ Projects  ](/admin/projects)\\n\\n\\n\\n#  Projects \\n\\n[ New Project  ](/projects/new)\\n\\n<::after> <::after>\\n\\n  * [ <::before>All ](/admin/projects)\\n  * [ <::before>Private ](/admin/projects?visibility_level=0)\\n  * [ <::before>Internal ](/admin/projects?visibility_level=10)\\n  * [ <::before>Public ](/admin/projects?visibility_level=20)\\n\\n\\n\\nLanguage \\n\\n  * [ Any ](/admin/projects?sort=latest_activity_desc)\\n\\n\\n\\nUpdated date \\n\\n  * Sort by \\n  * [ Updated date ](/admin/projects?sort=latest_activity_desc)\\n  * [ Last created ](/admin/projects?sort=created_desc)\\n  * [ Name ](/admin/projects?sort=name_asc)\\n  * [ Name, descending ](/admin/projects?sort=name_desc)\\n  * [ Most stars ](/admin/projects?sort=stars_desc)\\n  * [ Oldest updated ](/admin/projects?sort=latest_activity_asc)\\n  * [ Oldest created ](/admin/projects?sort=created_asc)\\n  * [ Largest repository ](/admin/projects?sort=storage_size_desc)\\n  *   * [ Hide archived projects ](/admin/projects?sort=latest_activity_desc)\\n  * [ Show archived projects ](/admin/projects?archived=true&sort=latest_activity_desc)\\n  * [ Show archived projects only ](/admin/projects?archived=only&sort=latest_act